; Sleef module-definition file -- the export list for Sleef.dll.
;
; The vendored Sleef upstream scalar amalgamation (BSL-1.0, Naoki Shibata
; and contributors 2010 - 2024) carries no __declspec(dllexport)
; annotations because the upstream code is plain C intended for static
; embedding. XPact emits Sleef as a per-module DLL like every other
; XPact module, so the linker needs an explicit export list to produce
; the import library Sleef.lib that XCore (and any other consumer of the
; sim-path math substrate) links against.
;
; This .def file is the structurally-correct way to export a vendored
; library's public surface without touching the upstream source: link.exe
; reads /DEF:Sleef.def, emits the named symbols into the .dll's export
; table, and writes the matching Sleef.lib import library next to the
; .dll. The upstream sources stay byte-identical to the vendored drop.
;
; Wired into the link line by XMSVCToolChain.LinkModule via the
; module_def_file TOML field on Sleef.Build.toml. Per Sleef.h the public
; surface is the scalar transcendentals only; the SIMD entries that the
; upstream header carries are stripped from this vendored subset per
; XCore-4a Rev 3 Section 6.3 + Toolchain Contract Rev 13 Section 4
; (sim-path determinism contract forbids SIMD math substrates).

EXPORTS
    ; Single-precision scalar transcendentals (Sleef u35 / u10 ULP tier).
    Sleef_sinf_u35
    Sleef_cosf_u35
    Sleef_tanf_u35
    Sleef_atan2f_u10
    Sleef_sqrtf_u10
    Sleef_powf_u10
    Sleef_expf_u10
    Sleef_logf_u10

    ; Double-precision scalar transcendentals (Sleef u35 / u10 ULP tier).
    Sleef_sin_u35
    Sleef_cos_u35
    Sleef_tan_u35
    Sleef_atan2_u10
    Sleef_sqrt_u10
    Sleef_pow_u10
    Sleef_exp_u10
    Sleef_log_u10
